{"id":"048daeb639b8a67f","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-circuit-sat-np-complete.md","title":"CIRCUIT-SAT is NP-Complete","display":"thm-circuit-sat-np-complete — CIRCUIT-SAT is NP-Complete","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-circuit-sat-np-complete","aliases":["28-thm-circuit-sat-np-complete","CIRCUIT-SAT is NP-Complete"],"display":"thm-circuit-sat-np-complete — CIRCUIT-SAT is NP-Complete","depends_on":["[[28-df-circuit-sat]]","[[28-df-sat]]","[[28-df-3sat]]","[[28-df-np-complete]]","[[28-df-poly-reduction]]","[[28-thm-cook-levin]]"],"eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-circuit-sat-np-complete"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-circuit-sat-np-complete</span><span>CIRCUIT-SAT is NP-Complete</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-circuit-sat-np-complete — CIRCUIT-SAT is NP-Complete"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a11f0e3e49cef083\" href=\"?note=a11f0e3e49cef083\" title=\"28-df-circuit-sat\">28-df-circuit-sat</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4041cfa2975b8dd1\" href=\"?note=4041cfa2975b8dd1\" title=\"28-df-sat\">28-df-sat</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5408daacba221251\" href=\"?note=5408daacba221251\" title=\"28-df-3sat\">28-df-3sat</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7a9125ebbfdef91e\" href=\"?note=7a9125ebbfdef91e\" title=\"28-df-np-complete\">28-df-np-complete</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"14088421136f8182\" href=\"?note=14088421136f8182\" title=\"28-df-poly-reduction\">28-df-poly-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e0fc90210de59068\" href=\"?note=e0fc90210de59068\" title=\"28-thm-cook-levin\">28-thm-cook-levin</a></span></div>"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CIRCUITSAT}\">\\(\\mathrm{CIRCUITSAT}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SAT}\">\\(\\mathrm{SAT}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{3SAT}\">\\(\\mathrm{3SAT}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NPComplete}\">\\(\\mathrm{NPComplete}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\">\\(\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\\)</span> 见对应定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CIRCUITSAT}\\in\\mathrm{NPComplete}\\land\n\\mathrm{SAT}\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\\mathrm{CIRCUITSAT}\\land\n\\mathrm{CIRCUITSAT}\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\\mathrm{3SAT}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{CIRCUITSAT}\\in\\mathrm{NPComplete}\\land\n\\mathrm{SAT}\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\\mathrm{CIRCUITSAT}\\land\n\\mathrm{CIRCUITSAT}\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\\mathrm{3SAT}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>R6 证据边界：门约束、无界扇入展开及归约正确性已复核；NP 难性采用上游 Cook–Levin 陈述，未完成一般计算编码的独立审计。因此本条保留为有来源的定理记录，不作为本次已完整核验的证明依赖。</p>\n<p>公式语法树可直接作为无共享电路，保持输出值；无效编码映到常零电路。本目录允许无界扇入门，故先把扇入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\ge2\">\\(d\\ge2\\)</span> 的 AND/OR 门展开为二输入门树；零扇入分别替成常一、常零，单扇入直接沿用输入线。展开后的节点和线数为原编码长度的多项式。再给每个门一个新变量：二输入 AND/OR 用等价的至多三文字子句，NOT 用两条二文字子句，常量用单位子句，最后要求输出为真。每个拓扑求值可延拓为满足赋值；反向局部门约束强制新变量等于求值，因此保持可满足性。原书还直接把验证器在输入固定后的计算展开成电路，给出不依赖 SAT 完全性的 NP 难性证明。猜测输入并按拓扑顺序求值给出 NP 成员资格。</p>\n<p>来源核对：定义6.9、引理6.10–6.11；印刷110–111页；PDF136–137页。陈述与两条归约证明结构已核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-circuit-sat","status":"resolved","id":"a11f0e3e49cef083","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-circuit-sat]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-sat","status":"resolved","id":"4041cfa2975b8dd1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-sat]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-3sat","status":"resolved","id":"5408daacba221251","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-3sat]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-np-complete","status":"resolved","id":"7a9125ebbfdef91e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-np-complete]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-poly-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"14088421136f8182","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-poly-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-thm-cook-levin","status":"resolved","id":"e0fc90210de59068","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-thm-cook-levin]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{CIRCUITSAT}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SAT}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{3SAT}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NPComplete}","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CIRCUITSAT}\\in\\mathrm{NPComplete}\\land\n\\mathrm{SAT}\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\\mathrm{CIRCUITSAT}\\land\n\\mathrm{CIRCUITSAT}\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\\mathrm{3SAT}.","display":true},{"tex":"d\\ge2","display":false}],"bytes":2070,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-103","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"电路问题与函数：[[28-df-circuit-sat]]、[[28-thm-circuit-sat-np-complete]]、[[28-df-majority-function]]。"}],"outgoing":["a11f0e3e49cef083","40